# Riverhold's characters and the labels on their alignments (DESIGN.md §5.1, §13).
load content/sample
characters

# Labels: an axis at or beyond ±33 leans that way.
assert show character player == player — The Player — law 0.00, good 0.00 — True Neutral
assert show character captain_hale == captain_hale — Captain Hale — law 75.00, good 30.00 — Lawful Neutral — member of city_watch since tick 0
assert show character sister_mira == sister_mira — Sister Mira — law 35.00, good 85.00 — Lawful Good — member of temple since tick 0
assert show character vex == vex — Vex — law -55.00, good -20.00 — Chaotic Neutral — member of lantern_guild since tick 0
assert show character brother_ash == brother_ash — Brother Ash — law 25.00, good -70.00 — Neutral Evil — member of ashen_circle since tick 0

# Mistakes are reported, with a hint when one is close.
assert show character vx == error: unknown character 'vx' (did you mean 'vex'?)
